## Dependencies

### Runtime
- Scryer Prolog (>= 0.9.0)
- Zenroom shared library (libzenroom.so/.dylib)

### Build
- Git
- CMake or Make
- GCC/Clang

## Installation

### Quick Install
```bash
./install.sh user
```

### Manual Install
```bash
# Build Zenroom
./scripts/build-zenroom.sh

# Copy to library directory
mkdir -p ~/.scryer-prolog/lib/zenroom
cp lib/*.pl ~/.scryer-prolog/lib/zenroom/
cp libzenroom.* ~/.scryer-prolog/lib/zenroom/ 2>/dev/null || true

# Set library path
export SCRYER_PROLOG_LIBRARY_PATH="$HOME/.scryer-prolog/lib:$SCRYER_PROLOG_LIBRARY_PATH"
```

## Testing

```bash
scryer-prolog tests/zenroom_basic.pl
```

Expected: 4/4 tests pass

## Usage

```prolog
?- use_module(library(zenroom)).
?- zencode_exec("Given nothing\nThen print 'test'", "", "", O, _).
```

